English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.

:INFO
1 Instead of the criteria stated in Article 40a paragraph 1, the amount of the compensatory payments made for measures to deal with forest damage outside the protective forest carried out before 31 December 2028 may be assessed according to the scope and quality of the measures.
2 Instead of the criteria stated in Article 43 paragraph 1 letter j, the amount of financial assistance awarded for public infrastructure facilities adapted or reconstituted before 31 December 2024 may be assessed according to the scope and quality of the measures.
|

:NOTE
Amended by No I 2 of the O of 31 May 2024 on Amendments to Ordinances to take account of Changes to Programme Agreements in the Environment Field for the Programme Period 2020–2024, in force since 1 Jan. 2025 (AS 2024 252).
